        <div class="intro__grid">
            <div class="intro__content" data-reveal>
                <p class="about-eyebrow">About Karnel</p>
                <h1>@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(websiteContent.AboutHeading) ? "A travel guide for the questions that come before the journey." : websiteContent.AboutHeading)</h1>
                <p class="intro__lede">@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(websiteContent.AboutDescription) ? "Explore the landscapes, destinations and experiences that make Pakistan extraordinary." : websiteContent.AboutDescription)</p>
                <div class="intro__actions">
                    <a class="btn btn--forest" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Destinations")">Explore Destinations</a>
                    <a class="btn btn--ghost-dark" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Contact")">Get in Touch</a>
                </div>
                <div class="intro__meta">
                    <div>
                        <strong>06</strong>
                        <span>Connected categories</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>01</strong>
                        <span>Guide across Pakistan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>100%</strong>
                        <span>Sample content, clearly marked</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="intro__media" data-reveal>
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
                     alt="Travellers walking a mountain trail in northern Pakistan"
                     fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
                <div class="intro__tag">
                    <b>01</b>
                    <span>Northern Pakistan</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- ==================== SECTION 02 — THE REASON BEHIND KARNEL ==================== -->
<section class="about-section about-section--ivory" aria-labelledby="reason-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="reason__grid">
            <div class="reason__media-wrap" data-reveal>
                <div class="reason__media">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
                         alt="Forest path with tall pines and filtered light"
                         loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <div class="reason__accent">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=75"
                         alt="Misty hills at dawn"
                         loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <span class="reason__caption">A quieter way to plan</span>
            </div>

            <div class="reason__body" data-reveal>
                <p class="about-eyebrow">The Reason Behind Karnel</p>
                <h2 id="reason-title">One place, before the journey begins.</h2>
                <p>
                    Planning a trip across Pakistan usually means juggling several sources
                    at once: one for destination ideas, another for transport, another for
                    hotels, and a final one for food. Each source has its own vocabulary,
                    its own pricing model and its own way of describing the same place.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Karnel Travel Guide is designed to bring those threads together without
                    pretending that every listing is live inventory. Where information is
                    still a placeholder, we label it clearly. Where a package is sample
                    content, the page says so. The aim is a guide that stays useful even
                    before the database behind it is finished.
                </p>
                <blockquote class="reason__pull">
                    &ldquo;A guide should help you decide — not ask you to trust it
                    blindly.&rdquo;
                </blockquote>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ==================== SECTION 03 — OUR TRAVEL PHILOSOPHY ==================== -->
<section class="about-section about-section--forest" aria-labelledby="philosophy-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="philosophy__head">
            <div data-reveal>
                <p class="about-eyebrow about-eyebrow--light">Our Travel Philosophy</p>
                <h2 id="philosophy-title">Three principles, quietly kept.</h2>
            </div>
            <p data-reveal>
                The guide is organised around a simple idea: give travellers the clarity
                and context they need to make their own decisions, without overstating
                what the platform can currently deliver.
            </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="philosophy" data-reveal-group>
            <li class="philosophy__row" data-reveal>
                <span class="philosophy__num">01</span>
                <h3 class="philosophy__title">Explore with clarity.</h3>
                <p class="philosophy__body">
                    Destinations are described in plain language, with region notes and
                    imagery that help you understand the place before you commit. No
                    inflated claims, no invented statistics.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="philosophy__row" data-reveal>
                <span class="philosophy__num">02</span>
                <h3 class="philosophy__title">Choose with confidence.</h3>
                <p class="philosophy__body">
                    Hotels, resorts, transport and restaurants are presented with sample
                    details and clearly marked pricing, so you can compare options on the
                    same terms instead of across a dozen open tabs.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="philosophy__row" data-reveal>
                <span class="philosophy__num">03</span>
                <h3 class="philosophy__title">Plan with transparency.</h3>
                <p class="philosophy__body">
                    Packages show what is included, what is illustrative, and how to reach
                    out. The point is not to close a booking in a single click, but to make
                    the earliest steps of planning feel considered.
                </p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

